Checkout now orchestrates cart, payment, and order for PER-161 story 04-app. A guest or signed-in shopper can check out on port 8004, and the service charges the cart total it just received.

- Payment refusal returns `{status: "refused", reason}` and leaves the cart and orders untouched.
- Payment acceptance creates the order, then deletes the cart. If that delete fails, the paid order is still returned.
- Swagger is at `/docs`. The service only opens `checkout_db`, which has no collections in this version.

Checkout tests: 14 passed. Cart (9), catalog (6), and identity (5) also passed when run separately.

